    "title": "Personalised risk communication for informed decision making about taking screening tests",               
    "selection_criteria": "Randomised controlled trials incorporating an intervention with a 'personalised risk         
communication element' for individuals undergoing screening procedures, and reporting measures of informed decisions and
also cognitive, affective, or behavioural outcomes addressing the decision by such individuals, of whether or not to    
